&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;当社監査役　３名&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;当社従業員　61名&lt;/p&gt;
